{"id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-effective-martingale.md","title":"有效鞅及有效上鞅","display":"df-effective-martingale — 有效鞅及有效上鞅","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-effective-martingale","aliases":["43-df-effective-martingale"],"display":"df-effective-martingale — 有效鞅及有效上鞅","depends_on":["[[43-df-martingale]]","[[43-df-supermartingale]]","[[43-df-left-c.e.-function]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.1.1 Definition 10.1.3，印刷206，PDF226","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-effective-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-effective-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-martingale — 有效鞅及有效上鞅"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e70aa52bbf815a8\" href=\"?note=4e70aa52bbf815a8\" title=\"43-df-supermartingale\">43-df-supermartingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a53577d80a47730\" href=\"?note=4a53577d80a47730\" title=\"43-df-left-c.e.-function\">43-df-left-c.e.-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.1.1 Definition 10.1.3，印刷206，PDF226"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowerSemicomputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowerSemicomputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a53577d80a47730\" href=\"?note=4a53577d80a47730\" title=\"43-df-left-c.e.-function\">43-df-left-c.e.-function</a>，鞅与上鞅见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e70aa52bbf815a8\" href=\"?note=4e70aa52bbf815a8\" title=\"43-df-supermartingale\">43-df-supermartingale</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveSupermartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveSupermartingale}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Martingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Martingale}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supermartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Supermartingale}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4e70aa52bbf815a8\" href=\"?note=4e70aa52bbf815a8\" title=\"43-df-supermartingale\">43-df-supermartingale</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(d)\\iff\\mathrm{Martingale}(d)\\land\\mathrm{LowerSemicomputable}(d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(d)\\iff\\mathrm{Martingale}(d)\\land\\mathrm{LowerSemicomputable}(d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveSupermartingale}(d)\\iff\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)\\land\\mathrm{LowerSemicomputable}(d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EffectiveSupermartingale}(d)\\iff\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)\\land\\mathrm{LowerSemicomputable}(d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>统一下半可计算；不要求每个近似q_s本身满足鞅等式。所有d值有限。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1.1 Definition 10.1.3，印刷206，PDF226。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"0038977b84ae1a9f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-supermartingale","status":"resolved","id":"4e70aa52bbf815a8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-supermartingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-left-c.e.-function","status":"resolved","id":"4a53577d80a47730","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-left-c.e.-function]]","embed":false},{"